WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.333
KATE BISHOP
As an Avenger, you showed me that

00:00:02.383 --> 00:00:04.860
you don't need
superpowers to be a hero.

00:00:06.821 --> 00:00:08.586
CLINT BARTON
I broke my tailbone doing that.

00:00:09.563 --> 00:00:12.763
You want to be a superhero?
There's a lot you'll lose.

00:00:13.302 --> 00:00:14.557
KATE BISHOP
There's also things you gain

00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:17.503
like trick arrows.
And cool costumes.

00:00:17.553 --> 00:00:18.839
CLINT BARTON
What's that on his head?

00:00:18.889 --> 00:00:20.128
KATE BISHOP
It's an H for Hawkeye.

00:00:20.178 --> 00:00:21.188
CLINT BARTON
Oh, wow.

